   "evidence": "`TauCeti/Geometry/Diffeomorphism/Sphere.lean:132` already builds `unitSphereDiffHom (m : \u2115\u221e\u03c9) : (E \u2243\u2097\u1d62[\u211d] E) \u2192* Diff (\ud835\udce1 n) (sphere (0 : E) 1) m` in that directory \u2014 the same kind of declaration. The moved block's only dependencies are Mathlib's `instance : LieGroup (\ud835\udce1 1) \u03c9 Circle` (`mathlib/Mathlib/Geometry/Manifold/Instances/Sphere.lean:578`), `Diffeomorph.smul` (`mathlib/Mathlib/Geometry/Manifold/Algebra/SMul.lean:205`), and `Diff` from `TauCeti/Geometry/Diffeomorphism/Group.lean`; `grep` shows no use of `SmoothEmbedding` before line 106.",
