   "fix": "Move the block to a new `TauCeti/Geometry/Diffeomorphism/Circle.lean` next to the existing `Sphere.lean`, importing `Mathlib.Geometry.Manifold.Instances.Sphere`, `Mathlib.Geometry.Manifold.Algebra.SMul` and `TauCeti.Geometry.Diffeomorphism.Group`; have `KnotTheory/SmoothCircle.lean` import it and keep only `SmoothCircleEmbedding` and its `rotate`/`reverse`/`smul` API.",
   "issue": "Lines 57-104 (`circleRotationHom`, `circleRotationHom_apply_apply`, `circleRotationHom_injective`, `circleReflection`, `circleReflection_apply`, `circleReflection_mul_self`, `circleReflection_inv`, `circleReflection_mul_circleRotationHom`) are facts about the self-diffeomorphism group of the circle as a Lie group. They use nothing from `SmoothEmbedding` and are broadly useful outside knot theory, but a future user of `Diff(S\u00b9)` would have to import a `KnotTheory` module to get them.",
   "line": "57"
  }
